{"4531620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Save The Ninja!", "steam_appid": 4531620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SAVE THE NINJA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A co-op stealth action game for up to 6 players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track wounded allies, reach them through hostile zones, and extract before everything escalates. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RESCUE MISSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Locate injured teammates  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Reach them through dangerous territory  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Carry and extract under pressure   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4531620/extras/9d081279602db8614a2af5bc020c84dd.poster.avif?t=1778824010\" width=912 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4531620/extras/9d081279602db8614a2af5bc020c84dd.webm?t=1778824010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4531620/extras/9d081279602db8614a2af5bc020c84dd.mp4?t=1778824010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VOICE NINJUTSU</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Use your voice to activate abilities  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Coordinate with your team in real time   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4531620/extras/836584e84a4dca980e8a5090f3503731.poster.avif?t=1778824010\" width=900 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4531620/extras/836584e84a4dca980e8a5090f3503731.webm?t=1778824010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steams